{"subject": "📊 Daily Portfolio: Markets closed | 3 pending GTC orders, no stop legs", "html_body": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n</head>\n<body style=\"margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #f4f5f7; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #111827;\">\n\n<table role=\"presentation\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"background-color: #f4f5f7; padding: 24px 12px;\">\n  <tr>\n    <td align=\"center\">\n      <table role=\"presentation\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"600\" style=\"max-width: 600px; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden;\">\n\n        <!-- HERO BANNER -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e293b 0%, #334155 100%); padding: 32px 24px; color: #ffffff;\">\n            <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #94a3b8;\">Daily Portfolio Check — Markets Closed</p>\n            <p style=\"margin: 4px 0 16px 0; font-size: 14px; color: #cbd5e1;\">Saturday, August 8, 2026 — Kuwait time</p>\n\n            <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\n              <tr>\n                <td>\n                  <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 11px; color: #94a3b8; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Total P&L</p>\n                  <p style=\"margin: 4px 0 0 0; font-size: 36px; font-weight: 700; color: #94a3b8;\">$0.00 <span style=\"font-size: 18px; opacity: 0.8;\">(0.00%)</span></p>\n                </td>\n                <td align=\"right\" valign=\"bottom\">\n                  <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 11px; color: #94a3b8; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Account</p>\n                  <p style=\"margin: 4px 0 0 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; color: #e2e8f0;\">100% cash</p>\n                </td>\n              </tr>\n            </table>\n\n            <p style=\"margin: 12px 0 0 0; font-size: 13px; color: #e2e8f0;\">🎯 <strong>Investment goal:</strong> $542.01 / $1,000 — <strong>$457.99 to go</strong> (54.2% there)</p>\n\n            <p style=\"margin: 16px 0 0 0; padding-top: 16px; border-top: 1px solid #475569; font-size: 13px; color: #e2e8f0;\">No open positions. Friday's session: TTD −27% and QDEL −21% on guidance cuts, DOCS +59% on an AI-driven beat — none of it touched your account, still fully in cash.</p>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- DECISIONS NEEDED -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding: 16px 24px; background-color: #fef3c7; border-bottom: 1px solid #fde68a;\">\n            <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; color: #92400e; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">⚠️ Decisions needed</p>\n            <p style=\"margin: 6px 0 0 0; font-size: 14px; color: #78350f; line-height: 1.5;\">3 GTC buy limits are still open per the last portfolio.json sync (Aug 5, 3 days stale): AXTI 2sh @ $58, SPXC 0.5sh @ $200, GOOG 0.3sh @ $365 (paired with a $408 sell — looks like a bracket, but <strong>no stop leg is visible on any of the three</strong>). Verify fill status in IBKR this weekend. If any filled, attach a stop-limit same day — this is the exact gap that turned the CAPR stop into a −72% fill.</p>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- SYSTEM NOTE -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding: 12px 24px; background-color: #fee2e2; border-bottom: 1px solid #fecaca;\">\n            <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 12px; color: #991b1b; line-height: 1.5;\"><strong>⚠️ Price feed unavailable this run.</strong> Yahoo Finance (query1 + query2) and the Stooq fallback were all blocked by this environment's network egress proxy — no live quotes could be pulled for AXTI/SPXC/GOOG. No prices were estimated or guessed. Check the broker app directly for current levels and order status.</p>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- MACRO CONTEXT -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding: 20px 24px 0 24px;\">\n            <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"background-color: #0d0d0d; border-left: 3px solid #f59e0b; border-radius: 6px;\">\n              <tr>\n                <td style=\"padding: 16px 18px;\">\n                  <p style=\"margin: 0 0 10px 0; font-size: 11px; color: #f59e0b; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; font-weight: 600;\">🌍 Macro Context — Aug 8, 2026</p>\n                  <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #e5e7eb; font-family: monospace;\">\n                    <tr><td style=\"padding: 2px 0;\">Buffett Indicator:</td><td style=\"text-align: right;\">~236% &nbsp;<span style=\"background-color: #7f1d1d; color: #fecaca; padding: 1px 8px; border-radius: 10px; font-family: -apple-system, sans-serif; font-size: 11px;\">🔴 ALL-TIME EXTREME</span></td></tr>\n                    <tr><td style=\"padding: 2px 0;\">S&P Forward P/E:</td><td style=\"text-align: right;\">20.2x &nbsp;(vs. 10yr avg 19.0x)</td></tr>\n                    <tr><td style=\"padding: 2px 0;\">Trend:</td><td style=\"text-align: right;\">↑ Rising</td></tr>\n                  </table>\n                  <p style=\"margin: 10px 0 0 0; font-size: 12px; color: #d1d5db; line-height: 1.6;\">Market cap is running ~2.4× US GDP — every prior reading this high has preceded a multi-year drawdown, though sources range 230–241% depending on methodology (globalization-adjusted reading is a much calmer ~116%). You're sitting 100% cash right now, which is the correct posture in this zone — no need to force an entry.</p>\n                  <p style=\"margin: 8px 0 0 0; font-size: 10px; color: #9ca3af; font-style: italic;\">Last historical episodes at this level: 2000 dot-com peak, 2021 post-COVID bubble peak — see buffett-indicator-history.html.</p>\n                </td>\n              </tr>\n            </table>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- POSITION NEWS -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding: 20px 24px 0 24px;\">\n            <p style=\"margin: 0 0 8px 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600;\">📰 Position News</p>\n            <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 13px; color: #6b7280;\">No open positions — nothing on enhanced news watch. Scan skipped.</p>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- POSITION SNAPSHOT -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding: 20px 24px 0 24px;\">\n            <p style=\"margin: 0 0 8px 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600;\">Position Snapshot</p>\n            <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 8px;\">\n              <tr>\n                <td style=\"padding: 14px 16px; font-size: 13px; color: #374151;\">\n                  <strong>No open positions.</strong> Last exit: IQV, stopped out Aug 4 at $227.91 (net −$4.56). Cash: <strong>$542.01</strong>.\n                </td>\n              </tr>\n            </table>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- MOVERS -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding: 20px 24px 0 24px;\">\n            <p style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600;\">📈📉 Friday's Movers — Aug 7, 2026</p>\n\n            <p style=\"margin: 0 0 6px 0; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; color: #059669; text-transform: uppercase;\">Gainers</p>\n            <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px;\">\n              <thead>\n                <tr style=\"background-color: #f9fafb;\">\n                  <th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 8px 6px; color: #6b7280; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\">Ticker</th>\n                  <th style=\"text-align: right; padding: 8px 6px; color: #6b7280; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\">+%</th>\n                  <th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 8px 6px; color: #6b7280; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\">What happened</th>\n                  <th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 8px 6px; color: #6b7280; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\">Type</th>\n                  <th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 8px 6px; color: #6b7280; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\">Contagion</th>\n                </tr>\n              </thead>\n              <tbody>\n                <tr>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 8px 6px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6; font-weight: 600;\">DOCS</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 8px 6px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6; text-align: right; color: #059669;\">+59%</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 8px 6px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6;\">Q2 beat + raised FY guidance; CEO said the AI-search product earns 10x its run cost — move amplified by a squeeze (16% of float short)</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 8px 6px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6;\">Earnings</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 8px 6px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6;\">None</td>\n                </tr>\n              </tbody>\n            </table>\n            <p style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-size: 11px; color: #9ca3af;\">Only one name confirmed clearing the 20% threshold from available sources for Aug 7 — not exhaustive of the full tape.</p>\n\n            <p style=\"margin: 0 0 6px 0; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; color: #dc2626; text-transform: uppercase;\">Losers</p>\n            <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 12px;\">\n              <thead>\n                <tr style=\"background-color: #f9fafb;\">\n                  <th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 8px 6px; color: #6b7280; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\">Ticker</th>\n                  <th style=\"text-align: right; padding: 8px 6px; color: #6b7280; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\">-%</th>\n                  <th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 8px 6px; color: #6b7280; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\">What happened</th>\n                  <th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 8px 6px; color: #6b7280; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\">Type</th>\n                  <th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 8px 6px; color: #6b7280; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\">Contagion?</th>\n                </tr>\n              </thead>\n              <tbody>\n                <tr>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 8px 6px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6; font-weight: 600;\">TTD</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 8px 6px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6; text-align: right; color: #dc2626;\">−27%</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 8px 6px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6;\">Q2 revenue +3% (missed consensus), Q3 guide of $650M implies a 12% YoY contraction — first-ever forecast decline. CEO cited tariffs, oil prices, weak CPG/auto ad spend</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 8px 6px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6;\">Miss/Guide-down</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 8px 6px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6;\">None</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 8px 6px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6; font-weight: 600;\">SEZL</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 8px 6px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6; text-align: right; color: #dc2626;\">~−24%</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 8px 6px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6;\">Beat on revenue (+52% YoY) and EPS, but guided H2 growth down to ~30% and flagged revenue yield normalizing lower — classic buy-the-rumor, sell-the-guide. (Sources range −22% to −31%; treat as directional.)</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 8px 6px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6;\">Guide-down despite beat</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 8px 6px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6;\">None</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 8px 6px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6; font-weight: 600;\">QDEL</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 8px 6px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6; text-align: right; color: #dc2626;\">−21%</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 8px 6px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6;\">Beat Q2 but slashed FY26 revenue ($2.52-2.60B from $2.70-2.75B) and EPS guidance on China IVD pricing pressure and soft respiratory demand; withdrew FCF guidance</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 8px 6px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6;\">Guidance cut</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 8px 6px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6;\">None</td>\n                </tr>\n              </tbody>\n            </table>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- LARGE-CAP ON DECK -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding: 20px 24px 0 24px;\">\n            <p style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600;\">🏢 Large-cap on deck — next 21 days</p>\n            <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 12px;\">\n              <thead>\n                <tr style=\"background-color: #f9fafb;\">\n                  <th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 8px 6px; color: #6b7280; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\">Ticker</th>\n                  <th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 8px 6px; color: #6b7280; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\">Event</th>\n                  <th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 8px 6px; color: #6b7280; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\">Date</th>\n                  <th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 8px 6px; color: #6b7280; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\">Setup</th>\n                  <th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 8px 6px; color: #6b7280; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\">Direction</th>\n                </tr>\n              </thead>\n              <tbody>\n                <tr>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 8px 6px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6; font-weight: 600;\">NVDA</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 8px 6px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6;\">Earnings (FQ2 FY27)</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 8px 6px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6;\">Aug 26 (AMC)</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 8px 6px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6;\">Consensus rev ~$91.8B, EPS ~$2.08, vs. mgmt guide $91B ±2%, 75% GM — hyperscaler capex still accelerating</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 8px 6px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6;\">🟢 Bullish</td>\n                </tr>\n              </tbody>\n            </table>\n            <p style=\"margin: 10px 0 0 0; font-size: 12px; color: #374151;\">💡 <strong>NVDA earnings Aug 26</strong> — beat-and-raise streak intact, guide midpoint conservative historically. Say <code>analyze NVDA</code> for the full setup.</p>\n            <p style=\"margin: 8px 0 0 0; font-size: 11px; color: #9ca3af;\">AVGO reports Sept 3 — 26 days out, outside the 21-day window, will surface once it's inside range.</p>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- PENDING WATCHLIST -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding: 20px 24px 0 24px;\">\n            <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background-color: #1a1400; border-left: 3px solid #f59e0b; border-radius: 6px;\">\n              <tr>\n                <td style=\"padding: 16px 18px;\">\n                  <p style=\"margin: 0 0 10px 0; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #f59e0b;\">⏳ Pending Watchlist</p>\n\n                  <p style=\"margin: 0 0 4px 0; font-size: 12px; color: #fde68a; font-weight: 600;\">3 unfilled GTC buy limits (per portfolio.json, synced Aug 5 — 3 days stale, not reconciled against IBKR this run):</p>\n                  <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #fef3c7; font-family: monospace; margin: 6px 0 12px 0;\">\n                    <tr><td style=\"padding: 2px 0;\">AXTI</td><td>2 sh</td><td>@ $58.00 limit</td><td style=\"text-align:right;\">no stop leg</td></tr>\n                    <tr><td style=\"padding: 2px 0;\">SPXC</td><td>0.5 sh</td><td>@ $200.00 limit</td><td style=\"text-align:right;\">no stop leg</td></tr>\n                    <tr><td style=\"padding: 2px 0;\">GOOG</td><td>0.3 sh</td><td>@ $365.00 limit (paired $408 sell)</td><td style=\"text-align:right;\">no stop leg</td></tr>\n                  </table>\n                  <p style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-size: 12px; color: #fef3c7; line-height: 1.6;\"><strong>⚠️ Price unavailable this run</strong> — can't tell you whether current price has moved through these limits or how far. Check IBKR directly for live status.</p>\n\n                  <p style=\"margin: 0 0 4px 0; font-size: 12px; color: #fde68a; font-weight: 600;\">Active watchlist candidates: none.</p>\n                  <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 12px; color: #fef3c7; line-height: 1.6;\">All five watchlist entries in portfolio.json (IQV, CELC, CAPR, VRDN, VERA) are archived closed trades, not live candidates. No fresh discovery has been run since the pivot to the on-demand <code>stock-finder</code> skill — say \"find me something\" when you want new names screened.</p>\n                </td>\n              </tr>\n            </table>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- CASH DEPLOYMENT -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding: 20px 24px 0 24px;\">\n            <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background-color: #f0fdf4; border: 1px solid #bbf7d0; border-radius: 8px;\">\n              <tr>\n                <td style=\"padding: 16px 20px;\">\n                  <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 11px; color: #166534; font-weight: 600; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">💵 Cash deployment — $540.01 deployable ($542.01 − $2 reserve/commission)</p>\n                  <p style=\"margin: 8px 0 0 0; font-size: 13px; color: #14532d; line-height: 1.6;\">No fresh discovery candidate is generated automatically here — that's what <code>stock-finder</code> is for. No live price feed this run either, so <strong>no order until levels are derived — run <code>analyze [TICKER]</code></strong> once you have a name in mind. Priority action before deploying anything new: resolve the 3 open GTC orders above (fill status + missing stop legs). Your call.</p>\n                </td>\n              </tr>\n            </table>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- IBKR INTELLIGENCE -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding: 12px 24px 0 24px;\">\n            <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 11px; color: #9ca3af;\">📊 IBKR Intelligence — not available in routine mode. Trigger daily check in chat for full broker analytics.</p>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- EDUCATION MODULE -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding: 20px 24px 24px 24px;\">\n            <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background-color: #f1f5f9; border-radius: 8px;\">\n              <tr>\n                <td style=\"padding: 20px 24px;\">\n                  <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 11px; color: #475569; font-weight: 600; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">📚 Today you learned</p>\n                  <p style=\"margin: 8px 0 0 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; color: #0f172a;\">Bracket Orders (OCO) — completing the trade, not just the entry</p>\n                  <p style=\"margin: 12px 0 0 0; font-size: 13px; color: #1e293b; line-height: 1.7;\">\n                    A GTC limit buy is half a trade. Your AXTI (2sh @ $58), SPXC (0.5sh @ $200), and GOOG (0.3sh @ $365) orders sitting on IBKR's book right now are naked entries — no stop, no take-profit attached. A bracket order (OCO, \"one-cancels-other\") submits all three legs together: buy, stop-loss, take-profit. The moment the entry fills, the stop and TP go live automatically; whichever triggers first cancels the other. IBKR supports these natively. This is exactly the gap that turned a planned CAPR stop into a silent −72% fill — the stop leg simply didn't exist when the entry did. If any of these three fill this weekend or Monday, attach the stop-limit that same day, don't wait for the next daily check.\n                  </p>\n                  <p style=\"margin: 12px 0 0 0; font-size: 12px; color: #475569; font-style: italic;\">\n                    Also today: <strong>Short squeeze</strong> reinforcement — DOCS's +59% move was amplified by 16% of its float being short, forcing covering into the rally on top of the fundamental beat.\n                  </p>\n                </td>\n              </tr>\n            </table>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- FOOTER -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding: 16px 24px 24px 24px; border-top: 1px solid #f3f4f6;\">\n            <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 10px; color: #9ca3af; line-height: 1.5;\">\n              Research output, not financial advice. Past performance does not guarantee future results.\n              Verify halal compliance quarterly on Zoya or Musaffa. Prices: UNAVAILABLE this run — Yahoo Finance (query1/query2) and Stooq fallback all blocked by network egress proxy; no prices estimated or guessed. Market/macro data via web search. Generated 2026-08-08 06:00 Kuwait time.\n            </p>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n      </table>\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n\n</body>\n</html>\n"}